  "estimatedMinutes": null,
  "statement": "Let \\(S\\) be a subset of the set \\(\\{1,2,3, \\ldots, 2015\\}\\) such that for any two elements \\(a, b \\in S\\), the difference \\(a-b\\) does not divide the sum \\(a+b\\). Find the maximum possible size of \\(S\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
